.TH tuvcard n 0.32.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tclutils::tuvcard \- vCard reader/writer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tclutils::tuvcard
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parses vCard text into a list of cards and serializes back with line folding.
See docs/tuvcard.md.
.SH KEYWORDS
vcard, contacts, parser
